<img src="https://static.boredpanda.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/59f31ece301c0_ggicbalm79py__605.jpg" alt="My Grandma Smoking Her Cigarette On The Farm. Wearing Pants And Doing Whatever The Hell She Wanted, 1938" /></strong>

<strong>17 - "Recentemente, perdi minha avó para o câncer. Essa vai ser sempre minha foto favorita dela"
</strong><strong><img src="https://static.boredpanda.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/cool-grandparents-38-5a097838f22fc__605.jpg" alt="I Recently Lost My Grandmother To Cancer. This Will Always Be One Of My Favorite Photo Of Her" /></strong><strong>18 - "Meu bisavô apresentando um dos cavalos que ele treinou para a Primeira Guerra Mundial - Petawawa, 1922"
<img src="https://static.boredpanda.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/5a030d951234d_ju1q2ejgxk4z__605.jpg" alt="My Great Grandfather Showing Off One Of The Horses He Trained For WW1 - Petawawa, ~1922" /></strong>

<strong>19 - "Minha avó com os astronautas da Mercury 7: John Glenn, Gus Grisson e Alan Shepherd (14 de setembro de 1959)"
<img src="https://static.boredpanda.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/59f32f58b618c__605.jpg" alt="My Grandmother With Then-Mercury 7 Astronauts John Glenn, Gus Grissom, And Alan Shepherd (September 14th, 1959)" /></strong>

<strong>20 - "Meu bisavô, Samurai de uma pequna cidade de minas de carvão, em Kyushu, posando com minha avó e uma de suas irmãs, em 1900"
<img src="https://static.boredpanda.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/cool-grandparents-84-5a0aa962c4b5e__605.jpg" alt="My Great-Great Grandfather, The Samurai Of A Small Coal Mining Town In Kyushu, Posing With My Grandmother And One Of Her Sisters ~1900" /></strong>

<strong>21 - "Meu avô morreu hoje. Eu quero contar o quanto ela era sinistro"
</strong><strong><img src="https://static.boredpanda.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/cool-grandparents-39-5a0978c0b78ce__605.jpg" alt="My Grandfather Died Today. I Want To Tell You What A Fucking Badass He Was" /></strong><strong>22 - "Minha bisavó, trabalhando como soldadora durante a Segunda Guerra Mundial"
</strong><strong><img src="https://static.boredpanda.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/cool-grandparents-26-5a096a0f77b17__605.jpg" alt="My Great Grandmother, Working As A Welder During WW2" /></strong><strong>23 - "Se eu pudesse ser só metade do quanto meu avô era sinistro, nesse Feriado de Memorial Day, Circa, 1960"
