 	<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Melhor álbum de rock - From The Fires, Greta Van Fleet</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Melhor canção de rock - “Masseduction”, St. Vincent</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Melhor performance de metal - Electric Messiah, High On Fire</span></li>
