 	<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Melhor performance de RR&amp;B tradicional - Bet Ain’t Worth The and, Leon Bridges / How Deep Is Your Love, Pj Morton Featuring Yebba</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Melhor performance de R&amp;B - Melhor Part H.E.R. Featuring Daniel Caesar</span></li>
